\label{thm:convres2}
Assume that parameters $\alpha_{N,n}$, $\tilde{\alpha}_{N,n}$, and $\beta_N$ are positive and suppose that, for some $\delta>0$ and $\kappa>1$,
\begin{align}
\inf_{n=0,\ldots, \lfloor \kappa N\rfloor}\frac{\beta_N\frac{1-\left(\frac{R}{r}\right)^{2(N+1)}}{1-\left(\frac{R}{r}\right)^2}+(\lfloor \kappa N\rfloor+1)^2}{{\alpha}_{N,n}}&=\mathcal{O}\left(N^{-2(1+\delta)}\right),\quad \textit{ for }N\to\infty.\label{eqn:ass4}
